-[Unit]
-Description=phial virtual machine %i
-Documentation=https://codeberg.org/pojntfx/phial-neo
-Wants=phial-swtpm@%i.service phial-virtiofsd@hostshare.service phial-virtiofsd@phial-secrets-%i.service
